Package: datamysteries
Title: Business Case Mysteries for Learning R and the Tidyverse
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person(
        given = "Hugo",
        family = "Cornejo Villena",
        email = "hcornejovillena@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
Author: Hugo Cornejo Villena [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Hugo Cornejo Villena <hcornejovillena@gmail.com>
Description: A collection of fictional business-case "mysteries" for
    teaching R and the tidyverse through case-based learning, aimed at
    management, marketing, and international business students. Each
    case presents a narrative business problem (e.g. a sales drop) that
    students investigate with progressively introduced R/tidyverse
    commands, ruling out decoy hypotheses to uncover the real root
    cause. Datasets and narratives are provided bilingually
    (Spanish/English).
